2. libde265 1.0.2, GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 or any
   later version (LGPL-3.0-or-later)
   Decodes the HEVC (H.265) image data.
   Source code: https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/tree/v1.0.2
   Release archive: https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/releases/download/v1.0.2/libde265-1.0.2.tar.gz
   License: COPYING-libde265 (libde265's COPYING file at v1.0.2, with the
